inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Temp<br/><b>-6&deg; a -4.5&deg;C</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Viento<br/><b>62 km/h</b></span></div></div><div style='border-left:5px solid #27c93f;background:#f7f7f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:6px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px;'><b style='font-size:13px;'>+6 a 12h</b><span style='background:#27c93f;color:#000;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;'>Sin alerta</span></div><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;font-size:11px;'><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> ECMWF<br/><b>0.9 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> GFS<br/><b>2.4 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> ICON<br/><b>0.5 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Isoterma<br/><b>2060 m</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Temp<br/><b>-7.3&deg; a -5.1&deg;C</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Viento<br/><b>51 km/h</b></span></div></div><div style='border-left:5px solid #e6b800;background:#f7f7f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:6px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px;'><b style='font-size:13px;'>+12 a 24h</b><span style='background:#e6b800;color:#000;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;'>Alerta amarilla</span></div><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;font-size:11px;'><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> ECMWF<br/><b>3.1 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> GFS<br/><b>12.5 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> ICON<br/><b>5.8 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Isoterma<br/><b>2420 m</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Temp<br/><b>-5.3&deg; a -3.2&deg;C</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Viento<br/><b>50 km/h</b></span></div></div><div style='border-left:5px solid #27c93f;background:#f7f7f7;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:6px;'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px;'><b style='font-size:13px;'>+24 a 48h</b><span style='background:#27c93f;color:#000;font-size:10px;font-weight:bold;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;'>Sin alerta</span></div><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;font-size:11px;'><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> ECMWF<br/><b>1.8 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> GFS<br/><b>3.8 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> ICON<br/><b>4.8 mm</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Isoterma<br/><b>1610 m</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Temp<br/><b>-9.7&deg; a -2.9&deg;C</b></span><span style='display:inline-block;min-width:52px;text-align:center;padding:3px 6px;border-radius:5px;font-size:10px;background:#f5f5f5;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;'> Viento<br/><b>52 km/h</b></span></div></div><small style='color:#888;'>Precip = acumulada por ventana, por modelo. Iso = isoterma 0&deg;C mas baja. Temp = min/max (prom. 3 modelos). Viento = rafaga maxima (peor caso, 10m).</small><br/><br/><hr/><small><b>Umbrales:</b></small><table cellspacing='1' cellpadding='1'><tr><td bgcolor='#00cc00'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td><small>&nbsp;&lt;5 o iso&lt;2500&nbsp;</small></td><td bgcolor='#cc9900'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td><small>&nbsp;&ge;5 + iso&ge;2500&nbsp;</small></td><td bgcolor='#ff0000'>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td><small>&nbsp;&ge;20 + iso&ge;3000</small></td></tr></table>]]></description>
